          </div>
          <p>Trusted legal expertise across Kenya — dispute resolution, family law, commercial litigation, land, employment, and criminal defence.</p>
          <div class="footer__tagline">⚖ Integrity · Strategy · Results</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer__col">
          <h4>Navigate</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about.html">About Us</a></li>
